---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Privacy Policy — Buzzyfly"
	description="How Buzzyfly collects, uses, and stores information when you buy a product or join the email list."
	pubDate={new Date('September 16 2026')}
>
	<p>Last updated: September 16, 2026</p>

	<p>
		Buzzyfly (buzzyfly.com) sells digital templates and checklists. This page explains what we collect, why, and how to reach us. Contact: coachmanager@gmail.com.
	</p>

	<h2>What we collect</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Email address when you join the list or check out through Stripe.</li>
		<li>Name and payment details handled by Stripe. We do not store your full card number.</li>
		<li>Order records needed to send your download link and handle refunds.</li>
		<li>Basic site analytics and security logs from our host (Cloudflare).</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>How we use it</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Deliver the file you paid for.</li>
		<li>Send the free weekly-reset checklist if you opted in.</li>
		<li>Send occasional product email if you are on the list. You can unsubscribe on any email.</li>
		<li>Answer support and process refunds.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Who else sees it</h2>
	<p>
		Stripe processes payments. Cloudflare hosts the site and stores product files. Email is sent through our email provider when delivery and list emails go out. We do not sell your email or order data.
	</p>

	<h2>How long we keep it</h2>
	<p>
		Order records are kept as long as needed for delivery, refunds, tax, and fraud checks. List emails stay until you unsubscribe or ask to be deleted.
	</p>

	<h2>Your choices</h2>
	<p>
		Email coachmanager@gmail.com to get a copy of what we have, correct it, or delete list and account data we control. Stripe holds payment records under their own policy.
	</p>

	<h2>Cookies</h2>
	<p>
		The site uses cookies and similar tech for security, checkout, and basic analytics. You can block cookies in your browser; checkout may then fail.
	</p>
</Layout>
